{"ID":"20251113182038-kqlin8t","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20251113182038-kqlin8t","title":"UPL9-16——善用 GPU 并行特性","type":"doc","updated":"20251113183129"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113182038-tkoysui","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251113182038-tkoysui","updated":"20251113182237"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"善用 GPU 并行特性是什么意思"}]},{"ID":"20251113182104-wsol79q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113182104-wsol79q","updated":"20251113182237"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"GPU 的强项是高度并行，同时处理成百上千个像素和顶点、线程同时工作\n善用并行特性，意思就是把计算分成许多相对简单、独立、可并行的工作单元，避免会破坏并行效率的做法！\n目标是让每个 GPU 线程做少量且规则的工作，从而提高吞吐量并降低延迟与功耗"}]},{"ID":"20251113182113-fuzpobq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251113182113-fuzpobq","updated":"20251113182552"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"向量化运算"}]},{"ID":"20251113182243-evflumr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113182243-evflumr","updated":"20251113182307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"GPU 的 ALU(算术逻辑单元)通常以 4-wide SIMD 形式工作，能同时处理 4 个 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"float"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 分量\n4-wide SIMD (单指令多数据流，Single Instruction, Multiple Data)，即 GPU（或某个执行单元）一次执行同样的运算指令时，会并行处理 4 个数据元素"}]},{"ID":"20251113182243-scj8tr7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113182243-scj8tr7","updated":"20251113182545"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因此我们在着色器中进行计算时，最好进行一次性“向量运算”，比如："}]},{"ID":"20251113182545-cvri2gb","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251113182545-cvri2gb","updated":"20251113182552"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113182545-1rr6krd","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251113182545-1rr6krd","updated":"20251113182545"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113182545-6chkwn0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113182545-6chkwn0","updated":"20251113182545"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不好的做法：分开计算"}]},{"ID":"20251113182319-lt07ks5","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251113182319-lt07ks5","updated":"20251113182326"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"aGxzbA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"float r = tex2D(_Tex, uv).r;\nfloat g = tex2D(_Tex, uv).g;\nfloat b = tex2D(_Tex, uv).b;\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]}]},{"ID":"20251113182548-4jqnumq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251113182548-4jqnumq","updated":"20251113182552"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113182552-3ke3aii","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113182552-3ke3aii","updated":"20251113182552"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好的做法：一次性向量运算"}]},{"ID":"20251113182552-ubg9ke3","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251113182552-ubg9ke3","updated":"20251113182552"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"aGxzbA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"float3 rgb = tex2D(_Tex, uv).rgb;\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251113182333-36zvful","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113182333-36zvful","updated":"20251113182342"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"向量运算示例："}]},{"ID":"20251113182342-zr4hheu","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251113182342-zr4hheu","updated":"20251113182344"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"aGxzbA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"float3 a = float3(1, 2, 3);\nfloat3 b = float3(4, 5, 6);\nfloat3 c = a * b; // GPU可以并行计算3个分量\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20251113182349-rvqz2v6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251113182349-rvqz2v6","updated":"20251113182530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"避免线程发散"}]},{"ID":"20251113182359-7nlck9t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113182359-7nlck9t","updated":"20251113182530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"GPU最小的同步执行单元（warp (NVIDIA) / wavefront (AMD)）中所有线程必须执行相同指令，分支会导致部分线程闲置\n比如："}]},{"ID":"20251113182431-r0vz1g3","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251113182431-r0vz1g3","updated":"20251113182517"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113182432-1rf8rsr","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251113182432-1rf8rsr","updated":"20251113182432"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113182432-84wo3x7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113182432-84wo3x7","updated":"20251113182432"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不好的做法：动态分支"}]},{"ID":"20251113182434-x9gjgen","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251113182434-x9gjgen","updated":"20251113182437"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"aGxzbA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"if (dot(N, L) \u003e 0)\n{\n    color += CalculateLight(N, L);\n}\nelse\n{\n    color += float3(0, 0, 0);\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]}]},{"ID":"20251113182440-0uavpe5","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251113182440-0uavpe5","updated":"20251113182517"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113182440-52o8xto","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113182440-52o8xto","updated":"20251113182448"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好的做法：使用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"lerp"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 或 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"saturate"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 避免分支"}]},{"ID":"20251113182449-6upw04o","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251113182449-6upw04o","updated":"20251113182457"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"aGxzbA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"float NdL = saturate(dot(N, L)) ;    //saturate函数 将输入值限制（clamp）在 [0, 1] 区间内\ncolor += CalculateLight(N, L) * NdL;\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20251113182359-8ptyvmx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113182359-8ptyvmx","updated":"20251113182517"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这样做可以避免线程闲置，尽量不要在 Shader 中使用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"if"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 语句\n如果确实存在分支，建议使用 Shader 关键字生成不同 Shader 变体"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251113182519-vbakmi9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251113182519-vbakmi9","updated":"20251113182636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"内存访问合并"}]},{"ID":"20251113182541-psu74wk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113182541-psu74wk","updated":"20251113182633"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"连续的全局内存访问可以被 GPU 合并为更少的内存事务\n随机访问或间隔很大的索引会导致散列访问，严重拉低带宽效率"}]},{"ID":"20251113182636-zflsl7k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113182636-zflsl7k","updated":"20251113182636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如："}]},{"ID":"20251113182600-tifxmm2","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251113182600-tifxmm2","updated":"20251113182628"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113182600-47ogggy","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251113182600-47ogggy","updated":"20251113182600"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113182600-miay2yp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113182600-miay2yp","updated":"20251113182617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不好的做法：随机访问"}]},{"ID":"20251113182617-vqac5fi","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251113182617-vqac5fi","updated":"20251113182621"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"aGxzbA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"groupshared float data[256];\nuint index = some_complex_calculation(tid);  //计算出来一个随机索引\nfloat value = data[index];\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]}]},{"ID":"20251113182605-hse3v86","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251113182605-hse3v86","updated":"20251113182628"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113182605-rvfnta7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113182605-rvfnta7","updated":"20251113182622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好的做法：连续访问"}]},{"ID":"20251113182623-u643w6i","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251113182623-u643w6i","updated":"20251113182628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"aGxzbA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"groupshared float data[256];\nuint index = tid;             // 连续索引\nfloat value = data[index];\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251113182541-eb7a9vo","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251113182541-eb7a9vo","updated":"20251113182742"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"预计算并行查找表"}]},{"ID":"20251113182700-e9y13ck","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113182700-e9y13ck","updated":"20251113182715"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"预计算并行查找表是，先离线或在初始化阶段预先计算好复杂函数的结果，然后在运行时通过查表快速获得结果，而不是实时计算\n假设有 1024 个像素线程需要计算相同的函数 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"f(x)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，如果你每个像素都算一次\n那么每个线程都要运行复杂指令、性能消耗线性增长"}]},{"ID":"20251113182718-my5i06i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113182718-my5i06i","updated":"20251113182741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"而如果我们通过查找表，每个线程只是访问一个数组或纹理，\nGPU 的纹理采样硬件是高度并行的，访问延迟被隐藏，带宽远比算力充裕，\n所以使用预计算查找表，可以让大量线程同时查表而不互相干扰，大幅减少算力压力"}]},{"ID":"20251113182742-4xltvz1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251113182742-4xltvz1","updated":"20251113182800"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"批处理"}]},{"ID":"20251113182751-f766k49","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113182751-f766k49","updated":"20251113182759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合并 Drawcall 可以减少 CPU 提交压力，让 GPU 在更大的批中并行工作，提升吞吐\n当存在大量相似小物体渲染时（草、树、子弹、UI 等），应该果断使用批处理"}]},{"ID":"20251113182800-2oem7sa","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251113182800-2oem7sa","updated":"20251113182851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减少与避免昂贵的原子操作"}]},{"ID":"20251113182810-xoa9g6m","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20251113182810-xoa9g6m","updated":"20251113182835"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20251113182812-dutke2b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113182812-dutke2b","updated":"20251113182812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原子操作"}]},{"ID":"20251113182814-zbuibxg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113182814-zbuibxg","updated":"20251113182835"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"指一种不可被中断的操作，在执行过程中不会被其他线程打断\n要么整个操作执行完毕，要么根本没开始执行，中间不会出现部分完成的状态\n原子操作保证了 多个线程对同一变量的读改写是原子的（不可分割的）\n原子操作一般是用在 GPU 并行计算 或 Compute Shader 或 多线程编程 时"}]}]},{"ID":"20251113182810-evef6hk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113182810-evef6hk","updated":"20251113182851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因此原子操作在高并发下会串行化访问同一内存地址，成为瓶颈\n我们应该避免在大并发写入场景（大量线程写同一计数器 / 全局 buffer）直接使用原子操作"}]},{"ID":"20251113182846-oiallja","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251113182846-oiallja","updated":"20251113183129"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减少数据依赖"}]},{"ID":"20251113182902-9xsybdt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113182902-9xsybdt","updated":"20251113182913"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"数据依赖（Data Dependency）指的是一个计算任务必须依赖另一个计算结果才能继续执行，比如："}]},{"ID":"20251113182913-ecsgocd","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251113182913-ecsgocd","updated":"20251113182957"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113182913-hjdnxcl","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251113182913-hjdnxcl","updated":"20251113182913"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113182913-8mzbecr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113182913-8mzbecr","updated":"20251113182918"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"顺序依赖"}]},{"ID":"20251113182919-l7649vb","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251113182919-l7649vb","updated":"20251113182920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"aGxzbA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"float a = data[i];\nfloat b = a * 2;\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20251113182916-ef90k2j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113182916-ef90k2j","updated":"20251113182925"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"b"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 的计算必须等 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"a"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 计算完成，形成顺序依赖"}]}]},{"ID":"20251113182913-jpmagyb","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251113182913-jpmagyb","updated":"20251113182957"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113182913-f6mizsz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113182913-f6mizsz","updated":"20251113182927"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"循环依赖\n一个循环中迭代依赖前一次结果"}]},{"ID":"20251113182927-1s0gpli","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251113182927-1s0gpli","updated":"20251113182957"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"aGxzbA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"for (int i) \n{ \n    data[i] = data[i - 1] * 0.5;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]}]},{"ID":"20251113182913-ap8oifp","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251113182913-ap8oifp","updated":"20251113182913"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113182913-utq8y82","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113182913-utq8y82","updated":"20251113182913"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"前后帧依赖"}]},{"ID":"20251113182953-nbprc38","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113182953-nbprc38","updated":"20251113182953"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在 GPU 迭代计算中，如果每个线程要用到前一个线程的结果，也属于数据依赖\n如果线程之间存在依赖，就必须等待其他线程完成，导致 串行化，降低并行度"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251113182910-roaew1j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113182910-roaew1j","updated":"20251113182910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]},{"ID":"20251113182902-vg4xb94","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113182902-vg4xb94","updated":"20251113183105"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因此我们要尽量减少属于依赖，让每个线程尽量独立计算，不依赖其他线程或前序结果，从而提升 GPU 并行度和吞吐率，比如："}]},{"ID":"20251113183044-xru94dj","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251113183044-xru94dj","updated":"20251113183101"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113183044-c940b7e","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251113183044-c940b7e","updated":"20251113183044"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113183044-3x62yfh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113183044-3x62yfh","updated":"20251113183044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"数据拆分、独立计算"}]},{"ID":"20251113183045-0u29me5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113183045-0u29me5","updated":"20251113183049"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"尽量让每个线程操作独立的数据，不依赖其他线程"}]},{"ID":"20251113183049-afdo1vs","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251113183049-afdo1vs","updated":"20251113183051"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"aGxzbA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"float b = data[id] * 2; // 每个线程只读自己的数据\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]}]},{"ID":"20251113183044-plhxh0x","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251113183044-plhxh0x","updated":"20251113183101"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113183044-8azen2s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113183044-8azen2s","updated":"20251113183044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"尽量把依赖计算移到 CPU"}]},{"ID":"20251113183059-itejyef","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113183059-itejyef","updated":"20251113183101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"某些序列依赖逻辑，用 CPU 先算，再传给 GPU 并行处理独立部分 1"}]}]},{"ID":"20251113183044-4rccdeq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251113183044-4rccdeq","updated":"20251113183044"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113183044-74f3i1g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113183044-74f3i1g","updated":"20251113183044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减少原子操作"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251113183042-zvgyjzu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113183042-zvgyjzu","updated":"20251113183042"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]},{"ID":"20251113183129-zdoy011","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113183129-zdoy011","updated":"20251113183129"}}]}